      "message": "build(deps-dev): bump the npm_and_yarn group across 1 directory with 2 updates (#3411)\n\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 2 updates in the / directory: [brace-expansion](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion) and [markdown-it](https://github.com/markdown-it/markdown-it).\n\n\nUpdates `brace-expansion` from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/compare/v5.0.9...v5.0.12)\n\nUpdates `markdown-it` from 14.3.0 to 14.3.2\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/markdown-it/markdown-it/blob/14.3.2/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/markdown-it/markdown-it/compare/14.3.0...14.3.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: brace-expansion\n  dependency-version: 5.0.12\n  dependency-type: indirect\n  dependency-group: npm_and_yarn\n- dependency-name: markdown-it\n  dependency-version: 14.3.2\n  dependency-type: indirect\n  dependency-group: npm_and_yarn\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
